WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Your song
Build a song from two progressions, remove a section, shape the others, and play it.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.960
1. Add sections
Press HOME for the Home page, and HOME again for the Song page.

3
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:14.920
1. Add sections
Press white keys 1, 2, 1 and 2.

4
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.920
1. Add sections
Each white key adds a section that plays its progression. You get P1 Pop, P2 Ballad, P1 Pop and P2 Ballad.

5
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:24.100
2. Remove a section
Turn KNOB 1 (Section) to section 4. Turn KNOB 2 (Prog) down, past P1, to "-".

6
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.100
2. Remove a section
The row says "section removed". Polly removes it when you leave the Song page.

7
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:33.660
2. Remove a section
Press HOME twice to go to the Home page and back to the Song page. Section 4 is gone.

8
00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.520
3. Shape a section
Turn KNOB 1 (Section) to section 2.

9
00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:44.600
3. Shape a section
Turn KNOB 3 (Groove) to B for the busier groove, and KNOB 4 (Repeat) to x2 to play it twice.

10
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:52.862
4. Mute the drums
Turn KNOB 1 to section 1. Press black keys 1, 2 and 3 to mute the drums and percussion there.

11
00:00:52.862 --> 00:00:58.242
5. Check the Intro and the Ending
Turn SELECT to page 2. KNOB 2 (Intro) and KNOB 3 (Ending) are on.

12
00:00:58.242 --> 00:01:01.242
5. Check the Intro and the Ending
KNOB 4 (At end) is on "stop", so the song stops after the Ending.

13
00:01:01.242 --> 00:01:08.942
6. Play the song
Press PLAY. The Intro plays first, with its clock filling up at the top.

14
00:01:08.942 --> 00:01:18.542
6. Play the song
Then each section's clock fills up as it plays. Section 1 plays without drums.

15
00:01:18.542 --> 00:01:37.742
6. Play the song
Section 2 plays Ballad on Groove B, twice.

16
00:01:37.742 --> 00:01:53.042
6. Play the song
Section 3 plays Pop again. Then the Ending plays, and the song stops.

17
00:01:53.042 --> 00:01:57.100
Next: 104
Changing styles.
